OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFurther
OL,6,Fheavy and thundery showers are
OL,7,Fexpected through the evening, though
OL,8,Fslowly easing overnight with clear
OL,9,Fspells developing. Staying mild, with
OL,10,Fa few mist patches forming by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FShowers return for the
OL,13,Fmorning, but these should generally
OL,14,Fclear for most during the afternoon,
OL,15,Fas a ridge of high pressure moves in.
OL,16,FFeeling fresher, with a northwesterly
OL,17,Fbreeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
